esource (saved or `inline`?)\n- Go to `Font` -> `Color` -> `Swatches`\n- Show all options (three dots button)\n- Quick load a local swatch resource file (`*.tres`)\n- Frequent chance of the Godot editor hang for 10-15-20 seconds or freezing and crashing\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is an intermittent problem, not deterministic, but frequent enough to create this bug report.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119166/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}